From d597fa847e2c5572e929e9bdc05273126b1d1f3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:28:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] patches: add NanoPi R28S support to OpenWrt

Backport OpenWrt PR #25667, which adds the FriendlyElec NanoPi R28S
(RK3528A) to the rockchip target, as of commit 0ec963186c05. On top,
replace the pending U-Boot patches of the PR with cherry-picks of the
six NanoPi R28S commits merged into U-Boot next for v2027.04. These
build the R28S U-Boot from the nanopi-zero2-rk3528 target.

Both patches apply on top of the OpenWrt commit Gluon uses without
changes and can be dropped once the PR is merged.

Link: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/25667
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
---
