+diff --git a/package/boot/uboot-rockchip/patches/002-03-v2027.04-arm64-dts-rockchip-Add-devicetree-for-the-FriendlyElec-NanoPi-R28S.patch b/package/boot/uboot-rockchip/patches/002-03-v2027.04-arm64-dts-rockchip-Add-devicetree-for-the-FriendlyElec-NanoPi-R28S.patch
+new file mode 100644
+index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..c37d80b66f37e8f1a42ce420598450340082a428
+--- /dev/null
++++ b/package/boot/uboot-rockchip/patches/002-03-v2027.04-arm64-dts-rockchip-Add-devicetree-for-the-FriendlyElec-NanoPi-R28S.patch
+@@ -0,0 +1,213 @@
++From 15dedffc7456e509c6e68a07896ef727a2582617 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: =?UTF-8?q?=E5=AE=89=E5=AE=B9?= <HystericalDragons@proton.me>
++Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:37:08 +0800
++Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: Add devicetree for the FriendlyElec
++ NanoPi R28S
++MIME-Version: 1.0
++Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
++Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
++
++The NanoPi R28S is a dual gigabit Ethernet router board based on the
++Rockchip RK3528 SoC, designed and developed by FriendlyElec. It shares
++most of its design with the NanoPi Zero2, so it builds on the common
++rk3528-nanopi.dtsi.
++
++Specification:
++- Rockchip RK3528
++- 1GB RAM
++- eMMC socket (optional)
++- MicroSD slot
++- 1x 1000Base-T (GMAC1, Realtek RTL8211F)
++- 1x 1000Base-T (PCIe, Realtek RTL8111H)
++- AICSemi AIC8800D80 SDIO WiFi + Bluetooth
++- 3x LEDs (SYS, LAN, WAN)
++- 1x USB 2.0 Type-C OTG, shared with the 5V power input
++- User and MaskROM buttons
++- Haoyu HYM8563 RTC
++- 1x USB Type-C debug UART (onboard WCH CH340E)
++
++The AIC8800D80 has no upstream driver yet, so only the SDIO and UART
++controllers it hangs off are enabled, along with the WiFi and Bluetooth
++wake and power pins taken from the schematics.
++
++Assisted-by: LLM
++Signed-off-by: 安容 <HystericalDragons@proton.me>
++Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260919-r28s-upstream-v7-3-e80a6f8ef521@proton.me
++Signed-off-by: Heiko Stuebner <heiko@sntech.de>
++
++[ upstream commit: c1e23f3425c49fe22e9598f8eea2fcf693950d50 ]
++
++(cherry picked from commit d0f6e37c635be183ff10d8a0291f54afd1365f30)
++
++Reviewed-by: Quentin Schulz <quentin.schulz@cherry.de>
++Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261103-nanopi-r28s-v3-3-ae8664fd168f@proton.me
++Signed-off-by: Quentin Schulz <u-boot@0leil.net>
++(cherry picked from commit fa7e4782468fbfa95dee2b21abde5cd86810a927)
++---
