+new file mode 100644
+index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..fb9a87de0c087f9744ff987668310fe7be9a01b5
+--- /dev/null
++++ b/package/boot/uboot-rockchip/patches/002-05-v2027.04-board-rockchip-Add-common-NanoPi-RK3528-board-target.patch
+@@ -0,0 +1,197 @@
++From e11b3c092128e080fabec4c815ab3c1fd9cff3b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: =?UTF-8?q?=E5=AE=89=E5=AE=B9?= <HystericalDragons@proton.me>
++Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:37:10 +0800
++Subject: [PATCH] board: rockchip: Add common NanoPi RK3528 board target
++MIME-Version: 1.0
++Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
++Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
++
++The board variant of the FriendlyElec NanoPi RK3528 family can be
++identified using the HW_ID voltage divider on SARADC channel 2.
++
++Add a TARGET_NANOPI_RK3528 board target, based on the Radxa ROCK 2
++board target, that reads HW_ID to select the FDT in SPL and to set the
++fdtfile env var. This allows one defconfig to support multiple NanoPi
++RK3528 board variants.
++
++Move the NanoPi Zero2 to the new board target, it is the only variant
++for now.
++
++Suggested-by: Jonas Karlman <jonas@kwiboo.se>
++Signed-off-by: 安容 <HystericalDragons@proton.me>
++Reviewed-by: Quentin Schulz <quentin.schulz@cherry.de>
++Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261103-nanopi-r28s-v3-5-ae8664fd168f@proton.me
++Signed-off-by: Quentin Schulz <u-boot@0leil.net>
++(cherry picked from commit 3ad7bc377887f87ef917f4c9bd790d70d37f90c8)
++[ rk3528/MAINTAINERS: context lacks the HINLINK-H28K entry from 64e0d6a036 ]
++---
++ arch/arm/dts/rk3528-nanopi-u-boot.dtsi        |  5 ++
++ arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3528/Kconfig         |  6 ++
++ arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3528/MAINTAINERS     |  7 ---
++ board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/Kconfig      | 14 +++++
++ board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/MAINTAINERS  |  7 +++
++ board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/Makefile     |  3 +
++ .../nanopi-rk3528/nanopi-rk3528.c             | 59 +++++++++++++++++++
++ configs/nanopi-zero2-rk3528_defconfig         |  1 +
++ 8 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
++ create mode 100644 board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/Kconfig
++ create mode 100644 board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/MAINTAINERS
++ create mode 100644 board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/Makefile
++ create mode 100644 board/friendlyelec/nanopi-rk3528/nanopi-rk3528.c
++
++--- a/arch/arm/dts/rk3528-nanopi-u-boot.dtsi
+++++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3528-nanopi-u-boot.dtsi
++@@ -2,6 +2,11 @@
++ 
++ #include "rk3528-u-boot.dtsi"
++ 
